OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADisorder at balloon release
OL,4,Aunacceptable, says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FRedcar MP Anna Turley said the event
OL,7,F"put lives at risk" and left residents
OL,8,F"frightened and angry in their own
OL,9,Fcommunities", adding: "People have a
OL,10,Fright to grieve and to pay their
OL,11,Frespects - but people also have a right
OL,12,Fto feel safe in their own homes and
OL,13,Fneighbourhoods."
OL,15,FThe BBC has contacted police and the
OL,16,Ffire service for comment.
